{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30018_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:36964ddeeae6664f30d04b2d7849c96f3b2837fa44bf72b5108b5b18addda033",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45811beccc273d6c4da57b58ab769721db3bc6da2cba40e3eed994b2268a89ad",
      "text": "上课当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d293b210919b85aebd2890167eb88a2c56374936923c38ea0937df86c7d28d8",
      "text": "北斗，你看得出我的表演还有什么不足之处吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74362d0f87e99c7519565412be7193959cbda8d310662b5bae9f940392a9bf88",
      "text": "啊，我也想要建议！稍微看我一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:552ad0b224854e5c8519dfe98dbfedf82898f3e029310e617a0413f6d4117195",
      "text": "“鼓起勇气，试着去跟对方搭话吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8002e65f13c63ecf3080f1c33eaab76c3b272b7529a5c95bc246b2a42933b838",
      "text": "这个嘛……首先冬马你，\n会不会稍微有点太用力了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dccbe2249261020ae1f85598c31caf5c569398929c8a570594f6a4d3dcba9268",
      "text": "如果给建议的人太僵硬的话，对方也会跟着紧张的\n嘛。试着以在背后推对方一把的感觉来演怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a150b7a200beb9a3509c552672d867aa2271ab91bb00fec1ec8d3b921ccfb573",
      "text": "太用力……也就是说，要放松肩膀的力道啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80e7968f3d41b1a8951a2b129c9a08ffd6350bf26dc1f627f5a9771cc48fda7d",
      "text": "翔太的话，或许更注重自然的状态会比较好哦。\n比起刻意去演，那样反而更能打动对方的心灵哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edb9e80a04d717407dd7b00ef3c9987af85688ee66f1fdec2e2f37ec15753ac8",
      "text": "刚才光想着必须好好演，不知不觉就浑身紧绷了。\n不愧是北斗君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b5ad4251ffa68abd7871cbb1d92a4c47af7358aa38b554d79e7a83cb7b59bd8",
      "text": "呵呵，毕竟彼此交往的时间也不短了嘛。\n那么，再试一次看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000152:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c710de22af2d5a9636c0d1f4b65c3da75cb1bbc836b3f6ef923b9d5b8acddf22",
      "text": "课程结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdb9752a98226e2951fbe7a34dfdf6f48e5ef7d45c4b00a2f3561cf156a41ace",
      "text": "恋爱顾问啊～……\n总觉得北斗君跟恋爱烦恼完全无缘呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74c313948353b7227c56e0222ce2b06cf98208a122cbce6f6e0eb8385ae9631d",
      "text": "没那回事哦。\n我也和大家一样，常常有很多烦恼呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b25aceebd7af540167060aed80c9e75028af885713102e875799708444d929ce",
      "text": "嘴上这么说，但不管遇到什么事总是游刃有余\n的样子，才最像北斗嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
